      "archaeologicalRemains": "unknown",
      "details": "<p>The Helsinki Atlas location follows earlier proposals that identify Lusanda\u00a0as Karah\u00fcy\u00fck, which is near Elbistan. Despite displaying\u00a0<span>Lusanda</span>\u00a0on Map 2, the Helsinki Atlas regards the certainty of that place as\u00a0category \"4\" (conjectural or speculative). Note that this location likely falls outside the borders of Que in the ninth century BC and that one should look for Lusanda closer to\u00a0<span>Cilicia Pedias.</span></p>",
